```java
public int power(int base, int exp) {
    if (exp == 0) {
        return 1;
    }
    return base * power(base, exp - 1);
}

// elsewhere:
System.out.println(power(2, 4));
```

What is printed?

```java
public int fibonacci(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) {
        return n;
    }
    return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);
}

// elsewhere:
System.out.println(fibonacci(5));
